 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.2,
   "text": "You may have heard of Rayleigh scattering as the answer to the question, why is the",
   "avg_logprob": -0.134,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 3.2,
   "end": 3.7,
   "text": "sky blue?",
   "avg_logprob": -0.134,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 4.18,
   "end": 5.06,
   "text": "This is sort of true.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.134,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 5.5,
   "end": 9.02,
   "text": "Bluer light scatters more off of air than redder light, so the sky is redder closer",
   "avg_logprob": -0.134,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 9.02,
   "end": 10.78,
   "text": "to the sun and bluer farther away from it.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.134,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 11.02,
   "end": 15.12,
   "text": "But honestly, a better answer to this question might be, because air is blue.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.134,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 15.84,
   "end": 19.42,
   "text": "Sure air appears blue for a bunch of physics reasons, but everything appears the color",
   "avg_logprob": -0.134,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 19.42,
   "end": 20.92,
   "text": "it is for a bunch of physics reasons.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.134,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 21.44,
   "end": 25.16,
   "text": "When you ask why is the Statue of Liberty green, the answer is something like, the",
   "avg_logprob": -0.134,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 25.16,
   "end": 28.34,
   "text": "outside of the statue is copper, so it used to be copper colored, but over time",
   "avg_logprob": -0.134,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 28.34,
   "end": 31.94,
   "text": "a layer of copper carbonate compounds formed through oxidation and corrosion, and",
   "avg_logprob": -0.211,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.026
  },
  {
   "start": 31.94,
   "end": 33.48,
   "text": "copper carbonate compounds are green.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.211,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.026
  },
  {
   "start": 33.98,
   "end": 37.5,
   "text": "You don't say, the statue is green because of frequency specific absorption and",
   "avg_logprob": -0.211,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.026
  },
  {
   "start": 37.5,
   "end": 41.88,
   "text": "scattering by surface molecules, so we should probably just say, the sky is blue",
   "avg_logprob": -0.211,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.026
  },
  {
   "start": 41.88,
   "end": 44.2,
   "text": "because the sky is made of air, and air is blue.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.211,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.026
  }
 ],
